  "The Peloton tool lets users search Peloton’s class library, view detailed class information, and build structured training plans. It can respond to prompts like “find 30-minute yoga classes for recovery days” or “create a two-week cycling plan.” Users can filter by instructor, class type, duration, and difficulty, then add selected classes directly to their Peloton schedule.": "通过 Peloton 工具搜索课程库、查看课程详情并制定训练计划。例如查找适合恢复日的 30 分钟瑜伽课程，或创建两周骑行计划。可按教练、课程类型、时长和难度筛选，并将选中的课程添加到 Peloton 日程。",
